{"abstract":[{"text":"Update existing features in a GeoJSON style source.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps","doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleManager"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"updateGeoJSONSourceFeatures"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"forSourceId"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"sourceId"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"features"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps7Featurea","text":"Feature","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/Feature"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dataId","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil)","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"sourceId","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A style source identifier."}]}]},{"name":"features","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The GeoJSON features to be updated in the source."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An arbitrary string used to track the given GeoJSON data.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"dataId"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The update operation will be scheduled and applied on a GeoJSON serialization queue.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In order to capture events when actual data is drawn on the map please refer to Events API","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and listen to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onSourceDataLoaded"},{"type":"text","text":" (optionally pass the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataId"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to filter the events)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onMapLoadingError"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"type = metadata"},{"text":" if data parsing error has occurred.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Partially updating a GeoJSON source is not compatible with using shared cache and generated IDs.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is important to ensure that every feature in the GeoJSON style source, as well as the newly added","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"feature, has a unique ID (or a unique promote ID if in use). Failure to provide unique IDs will result"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"in a ","type":"text"},{"code":"map-loading-error","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method allows the user to provide a data ID, which will be returned as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dataId"},{"text":" parameter in the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source-data-loaded"},{"type":"text","text":" event. However, it’s important to note that multiple partial updates can be queued"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for the same GeoJSON source when ongoing source parsing is taking place. In these cases, the partial","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"updates will be applied to the source in batches. Only the data ID provided in the most recent call within","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"each batch will be included in the "},{"code":"source-data-loaded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" event. If no data ID is provided in the most recent","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call, the data ID in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source-data-loaded"},{"text":"event will be null.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleError"},{"text":" if there is a problem updating features in the source.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.mapbox.MapboxMaps\/documentation\/MapboxMaps\/StyleManager\/updateGeoJSONSourceFeatures(forSourceId:features:dataId:)"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/mapboxmaps\/stylemanager\/updategeojsonsourcefeatures(forsourceid:features:dataid:)"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"MapboxMaps"}],"externalID":"s:10MapboxMaps12StyleManagerC27updateGeoJSONSourceFeatures11forSourceId8features04dataK0ySS_Say4Turf7FeatureVGSSSgtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"updateGeoJSONSourceFeatures"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"forSourceId"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"features"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Feature","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10MapboxMaps7Featurea"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dataId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"